## 4. Cloud Environment Configuration Matrix

| Service | Environment Variable | Purpose |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Render (Backend)** | `NODE_ENV=production` | Sets Node to production optimization mode |
| | `PORT=5000` | Port assigned by Render runtime |
| | `DATABASE_URL` | Aiven PostgreSQL connection URL (`?sslmode=require`) |
| | `CLERK_PUBLISHABLE_KEY` | Clerk public key for token verification |
| | `CLERK_SECRET_KEY` | Clerk private secret key for API validation |
| | `RENDER_EXTERNAL_URL` | `https://spa-complexe-rouis.onrender.com` (for self-pinger) |
| | `PUBLIC_APP_URL` | Frontend domain for booking management links |
| | `GUEST_BOOKING_MANAGEMENT_SECRET` | 32-byte secret for cryptographically signed guest links |
| | `TRUST_PROXY_HOPS=1` | Enables accurate IP resolution through Netlify & Render |
| | `SMTP_HOST`, `SMTP_PORT`, `SMTP_USER`, `SMTP_PASS` | SMTP server connection for notifications |
| **Netlify (Frontend)** | `VITE_CLERK_PUBLISHABLE_KEY` | Clerk public frontend key embedded in Vite build |
| | `NODE_VERSION=20` (or modern) | Node version for Vite build pipeline |

