## 5. Deployment Step-by-Step Summary

```text
1. Database Setup (Aiven):
   Create Aiven PostgreSQL instance ➔ Copy URI with SSL ➔ Set DATABASE_URL in Render

2. Backend Deployment (Render):
   Link Git repository ➔ Choose Node environment ➔ Set Build/Start commands ➔ Add Environment Variables

3. Frontend Deployment (Netlify):
   Link Git repository ➔ Build command: 'pnpm --filter @workspace/spa-platform run build' ➔ Publish dir: 'web/dist'

4. DNS & SSL:
   Netlify and Render automatically provision and renew Let's Encrypt SSL/TLS certificates.
```